  "narration": {
    "transcript": "Why willpower fails - and what actually works. Your problem is an arch: conclusions leaning on each other, built years ago under pressure. Push one stone and the rest hold it in place. But every arch has a keystone - the oldest conclusion, the one the others depend on. Loosen it with questions, and the whole problem loses its shape. Strategic Dialogue Hypnotherapy: question-led change."
  },
